1. OBJECTIVE & PROMPT
================================================================================
Objective:
  Author a reusable, shareable custom CoCo skill that other engineering teams can
  use to automatically validate supply chain ontologies and Cortex Analyst semantic
  models against Snowflake data schemas before deployment.

Prompt to CoCo:
  "Create a reusable custom CoCo skill called 'supply-chain-ontology-validator'
   in .cortex/skills/supply-chain-ontology-validator/SKILL.md.
   The SKILL.md should:
   1. Accept a semantic model YAML as input.
   2. Check that it has relationships defined between all referenced tables.
   3. Verify that all 4 canonical metrics (OTD, Fill Rate, DOI, Landed Cost) exist.
   4. Confirm persona-specific verified queries exist.
   5. Check for NULLIF division-by-zero protection.
   6. Provide a companion Python validation script and output a compliance report."

